{"kind":"event","event_id":8187,"event_uid":"01M2PRRAQQK9TSDPWDYZEVNGDJ","origin_instance_uid":"01M29GPTT4YE7ZYSCW8FVMKZ1J","type":"issue.commented","project_id":33,"project_uid":"01M2HSJCAB4WXJ7C6XEG23B869","project_name":"popmechanic-tinyapp-fixture","issue_id":339,"issue_uid":"01M2PRGBAVYCD5XMAY7P451DQ0","issue_short_id":"1dq0","actor":"impl:1@run-27","hlc_physical_ms":1789618039543,"hlc_counter":0,"content_hash":"79d4853cf82fb28d9984b45f12eeb120bb056037986b72b93832a201249f8050","payload":{"comment_uid":"01M2PRRAQP6DQTGGJAVZF5FQ4P","author":"impl:1@run-27","body":"Task 1 start. Approach: de-spawn the nine exam files one at a time, in this order — design-system-installed (pure deletion), pin-todo, delete-to-trash, exam-page, undo-delete, persistence-exam, interaction-evidence, styled-page, derived-exam (the rewrites). For each: delete the spawning legs the Context names, rewrite the spawned greps over app files as readFileSync + the same predicate, and rewrite the spawned exam/CLI runs as in-process calls (runStateExam, runPersistenceExam, the tinyapp-history src functions). Then run the file alone and check the floor, and finally the M1 grep sweep over all nine.","created_at":"2026-09-17T04:07:19.542239313Z"},"created_at":"2026-09-17T04:07:19.543Z"}
{"kind":"event","event_id":8189,"event_uid":"01M2PRRFXCJETJDRK2W4RQAQ3C","origin_instance_uid":"01M29GPTT4YE7ZYSCW8FVMKZ1J","type":"issue.commented","project_id":33,"project_uid":"01M2HSJCAB4WXJ7C6XEG23B869","project_name":"popmechanic-tinyapp-fixture","issue_id":340,"issue_uid":"01M2PRGEPTJZDMMZ0KVEYT0M16","issue_short_id":"0m16","actor":"impl:2@run-27","hlc_physical_ms":1789618044844,"hlc_counter":0,"content_hash":"ae52f81ed1920c00ceabda5125777058fc16a801d7237006497269ae863a9bc9","payload":{"comment_uid":"01M2PRRFXBEFPDTP7R64AB2883","author":"impl:2@run-27","body":"Approach: de-spawn the twelve exam files. For each, delete the legs whose only content is a child process over another prover (the linter's tests, sibling exams, tsc), and rewrite the spawned grep/sed predicates over *app* files (client/src/*, package.json) as in-process readFileSync reads with the same predicate. Every in-process leg at BASE is kept verbatim. Then reword the comments/doc headers that mention bun/bunx/tsc/tinyapp-lint/spawn so the M1 pattern prints nothing. Floors per file are in the task Context; I verify each file alone.","created_at":"2026-09-17T04:07:24.843481486Z"},"created_at":"2026-09-17T04:07:24.844Z"}
